{
  "_comment": "The look picked out of look_sun and look_fill, against the level as it stands: a sky light twice as bright for fill, lighter paint, contact shadows, a softer sun and a restrained grade. No chromatic aberration and no white balance - both showed on the cockpit's edges as colour fringes and a blue cast. The Lumen quality overrides are last on their own; they cost a frame and showed nothing. Live, nothing saved; these values go into build_space_scene.py and Vanguard_setup.json. Run: Tools/Shots.ps1 -Preset look_final",
